/-! # C1 retained cover and component statements
Implication from the retained quotient, normalization tower and an actual
branch-free projective immersion. The cyclic fibre and component geometry
remain open bodies. HC no distance; AV milestone no distance.
-/
noncomputable section
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false
set_option maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
open CategoryTheory CategoryTheory.Limits AlgebraicGeometry
open HodgeLean.Adapters HodgeLean.RealDefs
open scoped BigOperators Manifold ContDiff OnePoint
